WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.590
You're offered your first full-time job,

2
00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.150
paying 30,000 pounds a year.

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.140
That's 2,500 pounds a month.

4
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.420
You can't wait for payday.

5
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:14.770
Your first payslip arrives, and the
money in your account is smaller.

6
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:17.410
Some of it was taken
before you ever saw it.

7
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.630
So why is the pay that lands in your bank

8
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.530
account smaller than the
pay you were offered?

9
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.790
In this mission, you'll
read a payslip line by line,

10
00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:28.230
from gross pay down to net pay.

11
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:33.210
Then you'll work out every deduction
on a 30,000 pound salary yourself.

12
00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:37.640
Your mission: calculate how much
of your pay you actually take home.
